WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.467
Production Postgres supports refresh materialized view concurrently under specific conditions.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.667
An appropriate unique index is required.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:13.032
Concurrent refresh is an availability technique.

00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:18.840
It does not remove the need for a refresh policy, freshness metadata, or monitoring.
